Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirtieth Episode\NThe Phantom Kite\NFlying Phantom Thief
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.33,0:02:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,How delightful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.03,0:02:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My crown is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.63,0:02:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Search for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.38,0:02:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.39,0:02:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.36,0:02:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The Phantom Thief Jiruba?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.68,0:02:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.89,0:02:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a strange thief who targets nothing but crowns.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.60,0:02:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only has he never been caught,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.00,0:02:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,no one has ever seen his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.59,0:02:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,All we know is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.73,0:02:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,, Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.86,0:03:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He's remarkably agile and terrifyingly strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.29,0:03:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Jiruba is so cool! I really admire him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.82,0:03:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now see here, Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.62,0:04:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.79,0:04:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Word is that wretched Jiruba showed up in the neighboring kingdom a month ago and stole their crown—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.57,0:04:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's how their crown got stolen?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.22,0:04:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course it was!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.28,0:04:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Who on earth is this Jiruba? He's a tricky thief, and no one knows where he comes from.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.51,0:04:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Word is he won't stop stealing until he's collected a thousand crowns.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.50,0:04:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Jiruba's a strange one, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.45,0:04:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And Father... Father's in danger, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.59,0:04:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't scare me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.68,0:04:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever. If they take it, just wear another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.55,0:04:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.84,0:04:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, it's a treasure of Silverland, crafted by a master crown-maker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.54,0:04:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look any different from the other crowns.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.73,0:04:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, you can never be too careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.50,0:04:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So if that crown is taken, we'll lose face completely before the citizens.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.46,0:04:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, I know. I'll be very careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.54,0:05:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.96,0:05:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.60,0:05:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is the Phantom Thief Jiruba.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.84,0:05:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone, shoot down that chump!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.94,0:06:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Take Sapphire's arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.39,0:06:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.13,0:06:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.43,0:06:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Give back the crown!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.16,0:06:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.08,0:06:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.35,0:06:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,H-H-Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.88,0:06:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.89,0:07:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely you heard the rumors from Nylon that Jiruba was coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.47,0:07:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet you let the crown be stolen so easily! How pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.03,0:07:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you forget that crown is our kingdom's treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.97,0:07:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I never expected him to come from the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.90,0:07:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just have to wear a substitute crown for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.44,0:07:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, even if it's only temporary, the stolen original won't be coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.67,0:07:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, our opponent is Jiruba, and we don't even know where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.20,0:07:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I just have to get it back, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.89,0:07:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll definitely get it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.24,0:07:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.07,0:07:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.74,0:07:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, these two will keep speaking ill of Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.06,0:07:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Impressive, Princess Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.60,0:07:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.27,0:07:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,how long will it take to reclaim the crown?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.26,0:07:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't wait two, three, or five years...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.16,0:08:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me three days!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.25,0:08:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, three days?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.64,0:08:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I will definitely retrieve it within three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.54,0:08:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.30,0:08:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, that sounds wonderful, Lord Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.39,0:08:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I am truly impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.67,0:08:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,To retrieve the crown from the Phantom Thief Jiruba in just three days... how impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.29,0:08:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, assuming you actually manage to get it back, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.04,0:08:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This should be entertaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.59,0:08:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be eagerly waiting three days from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.24,0:08:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What could anyone possibly do in a mere three days?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.90,0:08:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, there's nothing we can do against a phantom thief flying on a kite.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.13,0:08:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm going to fly, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.99,0:08:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,W-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.07,0:08:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.68,0:08:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.86,0:08:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, a poster for the circus in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.24,0:08:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. I'll go there and learn acrobatics from this boy, Trott.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.24,0:08:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You can't be serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.93,0:08:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,For a noble prince to do circus tricks...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.55,0:09:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Dr. Uranari, do you have another way to fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.87,0:09:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, about that... No, I'll study the grand ceremony now—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.03,0:09:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, there's no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.42,0:09:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The promise was for three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.78,0:09:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright. I guess I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.46,0:09:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.42,0:09:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Word is this kid Trott is going to ride an kite, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.91,0:09:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Dr. Uranari, find out what young Trott was doing when the crown was stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.11,0:09:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite the detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.72,0:09:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Jiruba's true identity might be young Trott.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.35,0:09:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.82,0:09:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And one more thing: we have to lure out Phantom Thief Jiruba.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.38,0:09:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Lure them out?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.51,0:09:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.58,0:09:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I see. That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.50,0:09:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Post that notice all over town, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.74,0:09:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, with this, even the Phantom Thief Jiruba is sure to take the bait. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.20,0:09:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.44,0:10:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They're holding another military review in two nights?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.34,0:10:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.68,0:10:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,At night?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.93,0:10:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Furthermore, the crown stolen during the recent military review was a fake
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.86,0:10:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,made to fool the Phantom Thief Jiruba.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.29,0:10:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,See? There's no way the King would let a simple thief take the royal crown so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.02,0:10:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So it was a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.97,0:10:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Trott, are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.80,0:10:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're up next. Get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.73,0:10:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.78,0:10:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.04,0:10:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor, how did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.71,0:10:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems Trott was performing for the audience
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.17,0:10:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,when the crown was stolen. Several merchants saw him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.61,0:10:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.10,0:10:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So it wasn't Jiruba after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.52,0:10:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And notice about the crown has been posted all over town.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.62,0:10:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.96,0:11:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'm off to the circus to learn kite riding, Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.84,0:11:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn that Jiruba... did you see that just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.28,0:11:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Lord Sapphire, where are you off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.44,0:11:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little over two days left, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.45,0:11:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Step right up! The master of kite riding, the famous Trott!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.64,0:11:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,To start off, "Big Wave, Small Wave"!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.17,0:11:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Next up, "The Whirlwind Spin"!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.05,0:12:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, he will paint a picture in the blue sky for you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.50,0:12:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible! He doesn't even seem human!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.99,0:12:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.85,0:12:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The one who wants to practice kite riding?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.41,0:12:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.37,0:12:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Please make me your apprentice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.01,0:12:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He wasn't surprised to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.82,0:12:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So Trott really wasn't Jiruba after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.72,0:12:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You say you want to be my apprentice, but it's nothing like riding a horse, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.61,0:13:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We need someone brave, agile, and quick-witted.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.19,0:13:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.78,0:13:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm brave, agile, and very quick-witted.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.40,0:13:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,If I say so, it must be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.24,0:13:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, I'll take you as an apprentice... but what's with these soft white hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.16,0:13:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They're pale and slender, just like a girl's.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.06,0:13:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Stunt riding takes strong arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.26,0:13:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.62,0:13:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They may be thin, but I'm strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.04,0:13:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.92,0:13:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come over here and I'll test you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.42,0:13:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,First, try riding this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.84,0:13:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that Prince Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.34,0:13:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What is he doing in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.21,0:13:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.40,0:13:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, can you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.70,0:13:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.29,0:14:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.58,0:14:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.20,0:14:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Next is that one over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.00,0:14:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.36,0:14:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.62,0:14:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.60,0:14:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.42,0:14:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.58,0:14:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss is calling for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.18,0:14:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.16,0:14:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back, so keep practicing until I return.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.43,0:15:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for a quick break while he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.23,0:15:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it? Scoundrel, show yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.87,0:15:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Show yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.06,0:15:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.92,0:15:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That won't do. You need to practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.38,0:15:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you gotten any better?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.33,0:15:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Practice? I've got bigger problems!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.90,0:15:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I was almost killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.78,0:15:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of nowhere, someone threw knives at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.33,0:15:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.58,0:15:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can't dodge a knife or two, how do you expect to ride a kite?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.25,0:15:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't some flying swords come at you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.15,0:15:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's them! That's the ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.58,0:15:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,My hand slipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.25,0:15:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you switch to a bigger target?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.11,0:15:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If something like this falls on me, I'll be squashed flat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.05,0:15:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.80,0:15:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.53,0:16:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,More importantly, why do you want to learn kite-riding?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.72,0:16:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I have my reasons. I must master it by tomorrow night, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.26,0:16:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.94,0:16:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.50,0:16:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure you learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.38,0:16:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The key to kite-riding is arm strength and leg movement for balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.12,0:16:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Your left arm is too weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.60,0:16:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.76,0:16:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up and try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.14,0:16:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, keep equal strength in both arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.67,0:16:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If you lose that, you'll lose your balance and fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.47,0:16:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, you won't be able to ride the kite by tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.14,0:16:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.91,0:16:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep trying!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.05,0:16:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.21,0:16:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I've finally learned to ride the kite!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.06,0:17:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.32,0:17:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Phantom Thief Jiruba.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.96,0:17:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What an incredible fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.78,0:17:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,To master it in just a single day...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.90,0:17:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Trott, who do you think that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.78,0:17:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.01,0:17:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Prince Sapphire of this kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.97,0:17:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say, Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.46,0:17:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.46,0:17:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.95,0:17:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He was there when I went to steal the crown the day before yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.61,0:17:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No one from any kingdom suspected
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.54,0:17:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,that the two of us were taking turns playing Jiruba.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.32,0:17:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But we can't let our guard down around him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.55,0:17:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,They're using a fake crown,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.51,0:17:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,and they've even announced the date for the coronation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.68,0:17:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, it's like he's just making fun of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.99,0:17:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright! Tonight, I'm definitely stealing Silverland's crown.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.76,0:17:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.55,0:17:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's master against pupil.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.43,0:17:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, go back to the castle and wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.32,0:17:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Trott!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.42,0:18:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's Jiruba!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.84,0:18:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.30,0:18:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,She's safe, she's safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.98,0:18:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.87,0:18:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.67,0:18:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, our promised time is running short.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.50,0:18:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.70,0:18:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sapphire, there's something on your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.52,0:18:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a note.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.71,0:18:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Read it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.58,0:18:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How dare you give me a fake crown.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.06,0:18:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tonight, I will definitely come for the real one.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.73,0:18:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Phantom Thief Jiruba.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.65,0:18:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's from Jiruba!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.78,0:18:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's from Jiruba!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.83,0:18:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You fell right into my trap! Sapphire challenges you to a duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.32,0:19:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's finally time for the military parade.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.59,0:19:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't there any way to stop Jiruba the Phantom Thief from coming from the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.75,0:19:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.62,0:19:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Flying in the sky is easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.25,0:19:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We just need to pack this smoke into bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.51,0:19:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Tink, make them right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.00,0:19:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get the crown back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.79,0:19:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They're drawing close!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.85,0:20:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Something strange is falling!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.76,0:20:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what it is, but don't let your guard down!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.44,0:20:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Quiet down!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.40,0:20:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy is in the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.37,0:20:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your eyes on the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.29,0:20:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Consider it stolen!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.04,0:20:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.84,0:20:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Jiruba!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.40,0:20:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.08,0:20:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Luminous paint!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.76,0:20:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Jiruba!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.18,0:20:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.79,0:20:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If you lose your balance, you'll fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.41,0:20:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.25,0:20:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Why do you know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.10,0:21:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.17,0:21:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That crown is a fake!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.56,0:21:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.96,0:21:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I used it to catch you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.32,0:21:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You've beaten me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.63,0:21:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You're Trott!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.57,0:21:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.36,0:21:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Splendid!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.54,0:21:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.69,0:21:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Do whatever you want with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.64,0:21:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.04,0:21:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Why... Why would you do a thing like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.24,0:21:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.64,0:21:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you Jiruba's true identity!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.39,0:21:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,T-Trott has appeared again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.03,0:21:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.16,0:21:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We've lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.40,0:22:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say "brother"?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.24,0:22:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.10,0:22:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We're twin brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.29,0:22:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,One played Jiruba, while the other set up our alibi!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.64,0:22:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So there!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.52,0:22:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Dr. Uranari's great invention!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.28,0:22:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,A smoke-filled flying basket to catch Phantom Thief Jiruba!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.87,0:22:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Caught him! Caught him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.42,0:22:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.76,0:22:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.70,0:22:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.60,0:22:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Give up gracefully!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.91,0:22:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,They're out of our league!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.62,0:22:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.89,0:22:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire caught Jiruba!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.96,0:22:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.97,0:22:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you are, Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.92,0:22:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the real crown!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.82,0:22:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.54,0:22:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Do whatever you want with me, just please spare my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.06,0:22:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying, Brother?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.47,0:22:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take whatever punishment!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.73,0:22:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Please spare my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.44,0:22:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.14,0:22:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't spare either of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.16,0:23:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why were you only after the crown?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.18,0:23:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there a reason for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.76,0:23:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Long ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.05,0:23:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,our father served the king of a distant land.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.42,0:23:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,One day, when we were five...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.54,0:23:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He accidentally scratched the crown and was sentenced to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.57,0:23:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care how valuable that crown is—
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.71,0:23:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,which is more important, it or a human life?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.80,0:23:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Our father, the most important person in the world to us...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.56,0:23:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.97,0:23:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Envoys from various nations have come demanding we hand over Jiruba.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.12,0:23:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who caught him!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.59,0:23:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the judge!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.84,0:23:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He escaped!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.26,0:23:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Phantom Thief Jiruba escaped!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.42,0:23:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.40,0:23:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Phantom Thief Jiruba escaped!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.52,0:24:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch him!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.36,0:24:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the most magnificent, expensive crown is worthless
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.95,0:24:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,compared to a human life.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.09,0:24:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I understand why Jiruba stole every single crown.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.71,0:24:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And I think I understand why Sapphire forgave him.
